# Armada App

## Required workflow

1. **Verify token names** in `src/styles/tokens.css` before writing or editing UI.
2. **Follow `accessibility-a11y.mdc`** — strictly apply [A11Y.md](https://github.com/fecarrico/A11Y.md/blob/main/docs/en/A11Y.md) for all frontend work.
3. **Never hardcode** hex colors, raw `px` spacing/sizing, or font sizes — use CSS custom properties from `src/styles/tokens.css`. App-only roles live in `src/styles/theme-overrides.css`.
4. **Run `npm run build`** before marking any task complete.

## Tokens

This repo owns tokens and typography. Do not copy or overwrite them from another project.

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `src/tokens/armada-tokens.json` | Token Studio source (edit `semantic.typography` composites here) |
| `src/styles/tokens.css` | Primitives + semantic colors (hand-maintained with the JSON) |
| `src/styles/theme-overrides.css` | App-only roles (frost, overlays, theme motion, sheet max) |
| `src/styles/typography.css` | Generated composites — `npm run tokens:typography` |
| `src/typography/variants.ts` | Generated `TypographyVariant` — same command |
| `src/constants/depositChains.ts` | `DepositChainId` type + network icons |

Never hand-edit `typography.css` or `variants.ts`. After changing `semantic.typography` in JSON, run `npm run tokens:typography`.

## Styling

- CSS Modules per component (`Component.module.css`).
- Prefer semantic tokens (`--semantic-*`); use primitives when no semantic alias exists.
- Border radius and font-size primitives are unitless — wrap with `calc(var(--token) * 1px)`.

## Dev

- `npm run dev` → http://localhost:5177/
- App dashboard → http://localhost:5177/dashboard.html (prod: `/dashboard`)
- `npm run build` → `npm run tokens:typography && tsc && vite build`
